{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "composite": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "allowSyntheticDefaultImports": true,
    /*
     * `composite` 会 emit，而 `noEmit` 只写在 `package.json` 的命令行上；裸
     * `tsc -p tsconfig.node.json` 或 `tsc -b` 会在 `frontend/` 根目录生成配置的
     * `.js`/`.d.ts`。Tailwind 解析配置时优先匹配 `tailwind.config.js`，会遮蔽
     * `.ts` 的修改。这个 `outDir` 把声明产物改落到 `node_modules/.tmp`，避免
     * 污染配置目录与解析顺序。
     */
    "outDir": "./node_modules/.tmp/tsconfig-node"
  },
  // Everything that runs on node rather than in the browser — the tooling
  // configs and the Playwright specs. `references` from tsconfig.json does
  // not check these outside `tsc -b`, so they all belong in this one program:
  // checking only vite.config.ts would leave exactly the blind spot this
  // program exists to close, and an e2e spec that nothing type-checks is a
  // spec that can reference a removed selector helper and still look fine
  // until CI runs a browser.
  "include": [
    "vite.config.ts",
    "vitest.config.ts",
    "playwright.config.ts",
    "tailwind.config.ts",
    "breakpoints.json",
    "e2e/**/*.ts"
  ]
}
